        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "The Dunloe – 3 Bedroom House (Approx. 111 sq.m)\r\nThe Aherlow - 3 Bedroom House (Approx. 113 sq.m)\r\n\r\nThe Dunloe and The Aherloow are beautifully designed 3-bedroom family homes extending from approximately 111-115 sq.m, located within the prestigious new development at The Glen by Park Developments in Cabinteely, Dublin 18.\r\n\r\nThese spacious A-rated homes have been thoughtfully laid out to provide bright, well-proportioned accommodation ideal for modern family living. The ground floor features a generous living room to the front and a large open-plan kitchen/dining area to the rear, creating a perfect space for both everyday living and entertaining. Double doors open onto the private rear garden, allowing for excellent natural light throughout.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers three well-appointed bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with en-suite, along with a contemporary family bathroom. Each home is finished to a high standard, with careful attention to detail, quality materials, and energy-efficient design throughout.\r\n\r\nIdeally positioned, The Glen is just a short distance from the heart of Cabinteely village, offering a range of local shops, cafés, and amenities. Larger shopping destinations such as Cornelscourt Shopping Centre and Dundrum Town Centre are easily accessible, while the nearby coastal areas of Killiney and Dún Laoghaire provide a wealth of leisure options.\r\n\r\nThe area is well served by excellent transport links, including the N11 and M50 road networks, frequent Dublin Bus services, and the LUAS Green Line at Carrickmines, ensuring convenient access to Dublin city centre and beyond.\r\n\r\nBoth homes offer an ideal opportunity to acquire a stylish, energy-efficient home in a highly sought-after South Dublin location."
      },
